Scope

This license covers the files in this repository. It does not cover:

- vendor/vscode-git-graph-rs (a git submodule pointing at
  https://github.com/neophack/vscode-git-graph-rs), which is under its own
  licenses: its Rust engine (native/) is MIT, while its webview and extension
  host layers (web/, src/ and the compiled out/, media/) derive from Git Graph
  by mhutchie and are under the Git Graph license, which does not permit
  publishing, distributing, sublicensing or selling derivative works.

- Builds of the app. A build bundles that webview (media/out.min.js and its
  stylesheet, copied in by app/scripts/prepare-ui.mjs), so a built app may be
  used by whoever built it but must not be distributed (no .app, .dmg or other
  binary releases).
